apps.description:
HYPE, a Banca Sella brand, is the go-to account for those who recognize digital and technological innovation as crucial to improving their lives. As a Banca Sella brand, we create comprehensive and innovative products, designed to meet everyday needs simply and immediately.
HYPE Business is the account for self-employed professionals and sole proprietorships with VAT numbers.

With the HYPE Business app, you can always keep your personal and business expenses separate, revolutionizing the way your business manages its money.

Here are the benefits you won't be able to do without:
- Mastercard World Elite card, giving you access to exclusive offers to invest in your professional future and beyond;
- Card compatible with Apple Pay and Google Pay for smartphone payments;
- Free regular, instant, and periodic bank transfers;
- Savings Box to save your business money as you wish;
- Tax Manager to better manage taxes and contributions;
- Accident and health insurance package;
- Track all your spending;
- Free euro withdrawals at any ATM;
- 24/7 support, including WhatsApp.

Looking for an account to better manage your personal expenses?

Choose the HYPE solution that's right for you:
- HYPE: the zero-fee HYPE account. Free virtual card, free withdrawals up to €250 per month, free regular and instant bank transfers, SplitHYPE to create and manage shared spending groups, and personalized savings boxes.
- HYPE Next: All the benefits of the HYPE account, without any limits. Free physical card, insurance coverage for online purchases and ATM withdrawals, automatic debiting of expenses, free cash withdrawals, and spending control, including on other accounts.
- HYPE Premium: for those seeking perfection. Word Elite Mastercard, travel insurance coverage, free payments and withdrawals worldwide, priority support via a dedicated channel, and zero fees on all your spending. Naturally, the benefits of HYPE and Next are included.

Advertising message for promotional purposes. Product sold by Banca Sella S.p.A. via the HYPE app. For details and conditions, see the Promotions page and the information sheets on the Transparency page.
